  - m_Id: 22242802016256
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22296577187840
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22393297838080
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22428156698624
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22608121700352
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22646143066112
    m_Localized: Air bullet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22767836602368
    m_Localized: The compressed air stream turns into a deadly projectile of pure
      pressure.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22834450538496
    m_Localized: 'Instantly shoots at a target, bouncing off surfaces and recovering
      [[echo|echo charge]] when it hits an enemy.


      Affects: [affects]

      Speed:
      [moveSpeed]

      Damage: [damage.amount]

      Bounce count: [maxBounces]

      [[echo|Echo]]
      count: [echoCount]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22909906067456
    m_Localized: Ball lightning
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22932710498304
    m_Localized: A living spark of storm, roaming restlessly in search of prey.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23079586635776
    m_Localized: 'The projectile splits into [forkCount] additional copies upon impact,
      bounces off surfaces, and is attracted to enemies within a small radius.


      Affects:
      [affects]

      Speed: [moveSpeed]

      Damage: [damage.amount]

      Bounce
      count: [maxBounces]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23116743974912
    m_Localized: Charged shot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23269026570240
    m_Localized: Channels emerald energy into a charged magical arrow, drawn taut
      with arcane power.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23270830120960
    m_Localized: 'Damage that increases over time can be released at any moment.


      Affects:
      [affects]

      Speed: [moveSpeed]

      Damage at full charge: [damage.amount]

      [[charging|Charge
      duration]]: [chargeDuration]

      Pierce count: [maxPierces]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23475373744128
    m_Localized: Dirt wall
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23478402031616
    m_Localized: A surge of geomantic force erupts from the ground, raising a solid
      barrier of soil and stone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23667326066688
    m_Localized: "Blocks incoming attacks and reshapes the battlefield. \n[F] to
      alternate mode.\n\nAffects: [affects]\n[[echo|Echo]] count: [echoCount]\nWall
      health: 100\nMax walls: [spawn.instanceLimit]"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23685189607424
    m_Localized: Ember lash
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23698972090368
    m_Localized: A searing lava whip lashes out, ensnaring nearby foes in molten
      chains of fire.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23949078437888
    m_Localized: 'Captures enemies around the caster and deals gradual burning damage
      over time.


      Affects: [affects]

      Capture radius: [radius]

      Damage:
      [effect1.damagePerSecond]

      Damage interval: [effect1.tick]

      Duration:
      [effect1.duration]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24115806216192
    m_Localized: Fireball
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24117731401728
    m_Localized: A blazing sphere that erupts on impact, scorching everyone caught
      in the blast.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24260392263680
    m_Localized: 'Explodes on impact, dealing area damage around the target and apply
      [[forced movement|forced movement]].


      Affects: [affects]

      Speed:
      [moveSpeed]

      Explosion damage: [onHitSpawn.damage.amount]. Efficiency
      decreases with the distance from the explosion.

      Explosion radius: [onHitSpawn.range]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24261986099200
    m_Localized: Flame dash
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24356471185408
    m_Localized: Surge forward with blazing speed, leaving a trail of searing flames
      in your wake.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24358052438016
    m_Localized: 'Increases movement speed, leaving a destructive trail of fire.


      Affects:
      [affects]

      [[channelling|Channel duration]]: [channelDuration]

      Damage:
      [atStepDistanceSpawn.damage.perSecond]

      Damage interval: [atStepDistanceSpawn.damage.tick]

      Trail
      radius: [atStepDistanceSpawn.range]

      Trail duration: [atStepDistanceSpawn.duration]

      Movement
      speed bonus: [atStepDistanceSpawn.effect0.multiplier]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24521626099712
    m_Localized: Force field
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24534003490816
    m_Localized: A shimmering dome of condensed magic, bending light and matter alike.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24655256625152
    m_Localized: 'Absorbs incoming projectiles and then causes damage around itself.


      Affects:
      [affects]

      Radius: [radius]

      Area damage: [onEnemySpellDestroyedSpawn.damage.amount]

      Area
      range: [onEnemySpellDestroyedSpawn.range]

      Max fields: [spawn.instanceLimit]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24657462829056
    m_Localized: Frost nova
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3600922312704
    m_Localized: 'Triggers an explosive trap that deals area damage to all enemies
      who cross its path.


      Affects: [affects]

      Radius: [summonSensorRadius]

      Duration:
      [duration]

      Explosion damage: [mainSpell.damage.amount]

      Max traps:
      [spawn.instanceLimit]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3606903390208
    m_Localized: Scorching ray
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3610388856832
    m_Localized: 'Channels a continuous beam of fire; caster is slowed while maintaining
      it.


      Affects: [affects]

      Ray length: [coneLength]

      Damage:
      [damage.perSecond]

      Damage interval: [damage.tick]

      [[channelling|Channel
      duration]]: [channelDuration]

      Self movement speed slow: [effect0.multiplier]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3637819604992
    m_Localized: 'Teleports the caster forward, creates a [[forced movement|pulling
      area]] at the exit point.


      Affects: [affects]

      Cast range: [spawn.maxCastRange]

      Area
      radius: [range]

      Area duration: [duration]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3640101306368
    m_Localized: Shockwave totem
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3643788099584
    m_Localized: 'Inflicts damage and [[forced movement|pushes enemies back]] in
      bursts.


      Affects: [affects]

      Cast range: [spawn.maxCastRange]

      Burst
      radius: [mainSpell.range]

      Burst damage: [mainSpell.damage.amount]

      Duration:
      [duration]

      [[echo|Echo]] count: [echoCount]

      Totem health: 75

      Max
      totems: [spawn.instanceLimit]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3646426316800
    m_Localized: Toxic sphere
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3650276687872
    m_Localized: "Explodes on impact, creates an area that slows down and deals damage
      over time.\n\nAffects: [affects]\nProjectile speed: [moveSpeed] \nExplosion
      damage: [onHitSpawn2.damage.amount]\nArea radius: [onHitSpawn.range]\nArea
      damage: [onHitSpawn.damage.perSecond]\nArea damage interval: [onHitSpawn.damage.tick]\nArea
      duration: [onHitSpawn.duration]\nMovement speed slow: [onHitSpawn.effect0.multiplier]"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3651815997440
    m_Localized: Tempest vortex
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44340988079140864
    m_Localized: Frozen winds erupt in a swirling blizzard of snow, bursting outward
      with a chilling embrace.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44341039425810432
    m_Localized: 'Deals area damage, freezes and slows enemies caught in a snow whirlwind.


      Affects:
      [affects]

      Radius: [radius]

      Duration: [duration]

      Damage:
      [damage.amount]

      Freeze damage: [effect0.damagePerSecond]

      Freeze
      damage interval: [effect0.tick]

      Freeze duration: [effect0.duration]

      Movement
      speed slow: [effect2.multiplier]

      Slow duration: [effect2.duration]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44341290379407360
    m_Localized: Ice shards
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44341494335827968
    m_Localized: Razor shards of frozen air that pierce the ground and bind foes
      in frost.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44342074877833216
    m_Localized: 'Leaves icy spikes that freeze nearby enemies who step too close.


      Affects:
      [affects]

      Shards count: [spawn.instanceCount]

      Speed: [moveSpeed]

      Damage:
      [damage.amount]

      Freeze damage: [onHitSpawn.effect1.damagePerSecond]

      Freeze
      damage interval: [onHitSpawn.effect1.tick]

      Freeze duration: [onHitSpawn.effect1.duration]

      Spikes
      radius: [onHitSpawn.range]

      Spikes duration: [onHitSpawn.duration]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44342150039760896
    m_Localized: Pain mirror
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45818245528317952
    m_Localized: Surrounds the caster in a shimmering barrier that twists incoming
      agony back at its source.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45818268043341824
    m_Localized: 'Reflects a portion of damage taken back to attackers.


      Affects:
      [affects]

      Damage reflected: [effect0.multiplier]

      Effect duration:
      [effect0.duration]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3653393055744
    m_Localized: A raging spiral of wind that sweeps all aside and drags victims
      into its core.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3655020445696
    m_Localized: "Creates a moving vortex that deals damage over time and [[forced
      movement|pulls along its path]].\n\nAffects: [affects]\nSpeed: [moveSpeed]
      \nRadius: [range]\nDamage: [damage.perSecond]\nDamage interval: [damage.tick]\nDuration:
      [duration]"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3656412954624
    m_Localized: Furious sun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3669096529920
    m_Localized: Magic hand
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6966293430272
    m_Localized: 'Fires a projectile that leaves an icy ground trail; pierced targets
      are carried along with the spear.

      [F] to alternate mode.


      Affects:
      [affects]

      Speed: [moveSpeed]

      Damage: [damage.amount]

      Max
      distance: [maxDistance]

      Freeze duration: [effect1.duration]

      Trail
      duration: [atStepDistanceSpawn.duration]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6968143118336
    m_Localized: Charged shot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6971330789376
    m_Localized: 'Damage that increases over time can be released at any moment.


      Affects:
      [affects]

      Speed: [moveSpeed]

      Damage at full charge: [damage.amount]

      [[charging|Charge
      duration]]: [chargeDuration]

      Pierce count: [maxPierces]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3663186755584
    m_Localized: "Creates a moving sphere that deals damage over time; releases homing
      sparks as it moves, explodes when stopped.\n\nAffects: [affects]\nSpeed: [moveSpeed]
      \nRadius: [range]\nDamage: [damage.amount] of max [damage.percentOf]\nSparkle
      damage: [atStepDistanceSpawn.damage.amount]\nExplosion damage: [onLifetimeEndSpawn.effect0.dps]\n[[channel|Channel
      duration]]: [channelDuration]"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3671403397120
    m_Localized: A spectral hand slips from the void, grasps the target, and drags
      it toward its master.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3702143451136
    m_Localized: Ice spear
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3700998406144
    m_Localized: 'On hit, pulls the target toward the caster.


      Affects: [affects]

      Speed:
      [moveSpeed]

      Damage: [damage.amount]

      Max distance: [maxDistance]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3611919777792
    m_Localized: Shadow step
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3613354229760
    m_Localized: The caster slips between moments, stepping through darkness unseen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 59942831320625152
    m_Localized: Rune trap
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 59943040427651072
    m_Localized: Ancient runes ignite beneath the feet of the unwary, unleashing
      a burst of arcane energy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3608698552320
    m_Localized: A focused stream of flame that burns through flesh, will, and shadow
      alike.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3641959383040
    m_Localized: Summons a totem that emits shockwaves, striking nearby foes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3648410222592
    m_Localized: A swirling core of decay that poisons the ground it touches.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3658170368000
    m_Localized: A blazing sun that unleashes furious sparks and ends in a blinding
      detonation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6963130925056
    m_Localized: A shard of eternal frost cuts through the air, leaving a frozen
      trail and carrying impaled foes in its wake.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6969762119680
    m_Localized: Channels emerald energy into a charged magical arrow, drawn taut
      with arcane power.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
